      "content": "so you're saying the benefits are 'proven' but the costs are just something businesses have to deal with? that sounds pretty one-sided. if these mandates are doing more harm than good to the local economy and small shops, shouldn't we be calling them failures rather than just saying they have 'intended benefits'?",
